<title>USA: New York physical copper market - May 9.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - May 9.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for May shipment were quoted at a nominal 114.95 to 115.20 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 93.00 cents, down 1.00 cent from May 8th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
